{"id":"founding_village_milestone","title":"青石村的请求","body":"村民逐渐相信山上的三名少年确有仙缘，也带来了一桩全村无力解决的难题。","tags":["Founding","Relationship"],"sources":["FollowUp"],"isCritical":true,"expiresAfterDays":3,"participants":[{"slot":"actor"}],"options":[{"id":"repair_channel","text":"修整水渠","outcomes":[{"text":"堵塞多年的山渠重新通水，村民的疑虑消散大半。","effects":[{"type":"AddVillageRelation","participant":"actor","amount":20}]}]},{"id":"heal_sick","text":"救治病患","outcomes":[{"text":"有限的修为仍救下几名病重村民。","effects":[{"type":"AddVillageRelation","participant":"actor","amount":15},{"type":"AddReputation","amount":3}]}]},{"id":"teach_tools","text":"改良农具","outcomes":[{"text":"几件简单改造减轻了农忙负担。","effects":[{"type":"AddVillageRelation","participant":"actor","amount":10},{"type":"AddReputation","amount":5}]}]}]}
